<description>&lt;p&gt;Mass killings of Orthodox Christians have resumed in Oromia, with attacks in Arsi killing at least 60 people and road-blockade incidents killing another 55, according to the Ethiopian church. TPLF senior commander John Medid was captured in central Tigray by forces linked to the TPLF. Over 35,000 people have fled the fighting across the border into Moyale, Kenya, prompting condemnation from regional leaders. The UN mission in Somalia has concluded while the UN food programme appointed a new head amid the renewed conflict. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9lRnAyWFN6S1Q2cWx6b2pXZk1IblNMX3g0d1lpRXhqYWFPdnp4R3ctUmlnQlcyeUlJM3lldzFKVW9WdENxc21uUm9xOUg2Sy1PYV80U2VvWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE92bm0xcTFfYzhLRmRCUWRZY1hmWUdhOUctX1JVVzFMelFDcUhhZ3NPVDZfcDk3dXR6Q3NuTlh2SmZlR0I4SWYwTzd3eG4wNlBVTVpldVNwb2ZVcmdiYWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQYU9NZTlMaUpVWkpYbXpGU24yLXJhZk9GYy1md2pqVGtfUzZIN19RTmo5c3lyVUlpd1ljWkxZTmxpdS1fb29mNTVPUnRNbUljd2FFZ2xNZUZ2ZHIyb01WQUpTeGMwMnBkTENJd21hYTJIMVpyUFdLdUVnemEzeWpqMXVQY1VaSC1GdjZKSE5uMmtvMHZYX0xvTWdlRzUxOHVnR3phNkJUSGg5WG9aMnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channel Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPelE0cDdjbG5Pa2tBQXlPTEdxX3pVVVJJTWI1UmpETThweTRBUDJzX0x2OWZpSlhRb2FwcFlnYlA0YmZmajBFbjNUVmVYTEJWSUJJVmlzR0hDbmlmM0U1Skc0NkdzQVNJZHY0WC1lSmstcExTZGtVQ3lOaVZUUm9UVHdROE95a01xZ1NfbHFBQUxKV21wQ185ZDQwVFhyaHl3QWZJOE4wVWtYUkJfVl9QWkozaVgwS0V2Yy1V?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNa1BlYlhNVUtuc2hHVE1SX2tXTXlRUTJzUFhaR3lrV29wV2l1RG1pRk